  "helpScreenTitle": "Help & How to Use",
  "helpIntro": "Here's how to use Night Sky Encyclopedia, organized by topic. Tap a topic to expand it.",
  "helpTopic1Title": "How do I observe a constellation?",
  "helpTopic1Body": "From the home screen, tap \"AR Observation\" and point your camera at the night sky — the constellation lines will overlay on screen. Save any constellation you find with \"Save Record\" and it's automatically added to your catalog tab.",
  "helpTopic2Title": "How to read the Catalog tab",
  "helpTopic2Body": "All 88 constellations are grouped by category (Northern Sky, Southern Sky, Zodiac, and more). Constellations you haven't observed yet appear in gray, while observed ones show in full color. Tap a constellation to see its mythology and detailed data.",
  "helpTopic3Title": "City Light Challenge and the Bortle scale",
  "helpTopic3Body": "When you add an observation record, you log how bright the sky was at that location using the \"Bortle scale\" (1-9). 1 is the darkest sky, 9 is the brightest city sky. Observing in the city (Bortle 7+) is harder, and completing it brings you closer to titles like \"City Hunter.\"",
  "helpTopic4Title": "What is the Constellation Time Capsule?",
  "helpTopic4Body": "A record page for rare observation events that only appear during specific windows, like meteor showers or lunar eclipses. Observe during the event and leave a message, and it automatically unlocks on the date you chose, letting you look back on that moment. Miss it, and you'll have to wait for the next event.",
  "helpTopic5Title": "Light Pollution Map & observation stats",
  "helpTopic5Body": "From \"Light Pollution Map & Observation Difficulty\" in the Settings tab, you can check the Bortle scale distribution of your past observations and tips for observing. It shows what kind of environments you're best at observing in.",
  "helpTopic6Title": "How do I earn achievements and titles?",
  "helpTopic6Body": "Achievements unlock based on your observation count and other milestones, and appear as titles on your profile in the Settings tab. A progress bar shows how close you are to unlocking each one.",
  "helpTopic7Title": "What is Night Red Mode?",
  "helpTopic7Body": "A mode that tints the entire screen red to protect your eyes' dark adaptation. You can toggle it anytime from \"Observation Settings\" in the Settings tab.",
  "helpTopic8Title": "What do I get with Premium?",
  "helpTopic8Body": "The free version already covers the main features, but upgrading to Premium unlocks all 88 constellations and the full Time Capsule content, plus more. You can subscribe from the Settings tab.",
  "helpContactTitle": "Still stuck?",
  "helpContactSubtitle": "Feel free to reach out via Feedback & Bug Reports",
